## Production readiness (Stage 15)

Full design/UX/a11y/perf/code audit + refinements (no new sections, no
content changes):

- **Accessibility** — darkened the muted-text token (`#8892A0 → #68717F`) so
  all body/caption text meets **WCAG AA (≥4.5:1)** on every surface; verified
  every text/background pair, single `<h1>`, logical heading order, all
  `target="_blank"` links carry `rel="noopener"`, labelled form fields,
  visible `:focus-visible`, decorative icons `aria-hidden`.
- **SEO / production `<head>`** — Arabic meta description, `robots`, canonical,
  Open Graph + Twitter cards, inline-SVG favicon (brand mark), and
  **JSON-LD `TravelAgency`** structured data with the real NAP.
- **Performance** — hero image `eager`/`fetchpriority=high`, the rest
  `loading="lazy"` with fixed aspect ratios (no CLS); motion is transform/
  opacity only; `prefers-reduced-motion` honoured site-wide.
- **Verified** — headless Chromium: no horizontal overflow across
  320/360/390/414/600/768/834/1024/1280/1440/1728/1920; scroll-spy, services
  tabs, timeline, contact form, and mobile menu all pass; no console errors.

> Replace before launch: the canonical/OG `url` (deployed domain), social
